cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "PyNRPF: Detecting and rectifying wrong reverse power flow readings"
message: "If you use this software, please cite it."
type: software
abstract: >-
  PyNRPF (Python for Network Reverse Power Flow) detects and corrects a wrong
  reverse power flow sign in distribution network interval meter data. This project
  is part of Samhan's PhD study, supported by the University International
  Postgraduate Award (UIPA) Scholarship from UNSW, the Industry Collaboration
  Project Scholarship from Ausgrid, the RACE for 2030 Scholarship, and the NSW
  Decarbonisation Innovation Hub (NSW Decarb Hub).
